==German==

===Etymology===
<!--aus dem Obersächsischen, per Duden
-->From {{m|de|Schmetten||cream}} due to an old belief that witches transformed themselves into butterflies to steal cream and other milk products.<ref>{{R:Duden}}. / ''Duden - Deutsches Universalwörterbuch'', 4. Aufl. (Mannheim 2001)</ref> (Contrast the etymology of [[w:English language|English]] {{m|en|butterfly}}.)

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈʃmɛtɐlɪŋ/|lang=de}}
* {{audio|De-Schmetterling.ogg|audio (Germany)|lang=de}}

===Noun===
{{de-noun|m|Schmetterlings|gen2=Schmetterlinges|Schmetterlinge}}

# [[butterfly]] (insect)
# [[butterfly]] (swimming stroke)

